---
source: crates/krishiv-optimizer/tests/it/rules.rs
expression: "WITH g AS (SELECT a, b, count(*) AS n FROM t GROUP BY a, b) SELECT x.a, x.n, y.n FROM g x JOIN g y ON x.a = y.a WHERE x.b = 'p' AND y.b = 'q'"
---
Project [a#4, n#6, n#9]
+- Join Inner, (a#4 == a#7)
   :- Project [a#10 AS a#4, n#13 AS n#6]
   :  +- Shift +10
   :     +- Aggregate [a#0, b#1], [a#0, count(1) AS n#3]
   :        +- Filter (b#1 == 'p')
   :           +- Scan spark_catalog.default.t [a#0, b#1] (shared #1)
   +- Shift +3
      +- Project [a#10 AS a#4, n#13 AS n#6]
         +- Shift +10
            +- Aggregate [a#0, b#1], [a#0, count(1) AS n#3]
               +- Filter (b#1 == 'q')
                  +- Shared #1, printed above
